Authentication should be enterprise-first: OIDC/JWKS or SAML-backed human auth, environment-scoped RBAC, audited API-key lifecycle, and user-delegated tool authorization. API models should represent user, agent, environment, credential, provider account, approval, policy, and scope in the same decision chain. The SDK should expose token providers plus authorization challenge helpers. UI and backend permission maps should come from one source of truth. Tests should prove IdP validation, environment scoping, key rotation, session revocation, and delegated tool access.
